Comment: 50,0:00:17.00,0:00:17.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Cold Open
Comment: 50,0:00:44.02,0:00:44.07,Default,chptr,0,0,0,opsync,OP
Comment: 50,0:02:15.03,0:02:15.07,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part A
Comment: 50,0:12:26.06,0:12:26.10,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part B
Comment: 50,0:22:23.07,0:22:23.11,Default,chptr,0,0,0,edsync,ED
Comment: 50,0:23:53.08,0:23:53.12,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Preview
Dialogue: 50,0:00:27.13,0:00:29.09,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,That's a big cloud!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:40.27,0:00:44.02,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh right... It's been almost a whole year.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.16,0:02:24.42,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Okay, this should be all we need to get.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.42,0:02:26.42,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Can we buy beer too?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.42,0:02:28.29,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,We just got some, didn't we?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.29,0:02:30.84,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Sorry, I just lose control in this heat.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.84,0:02:32.26,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.26,0:02:33.47,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.01,0:02:35.18,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.18,0:02:36.34,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.34,0:02:38.35,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,You sure took your time.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.35,0:02:39.60,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Are you going out?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.60,0:02:42.73,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Yes, on a shopping trip to the next town over.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.60,0:02:45.23,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Can you buy me a souvenir?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.10,0:02:47.23,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.23,0:02:48.19,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.19,0:02:49.27,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,We're off now.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.27,0:02:50.94,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.40,0:02:55.45,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:57.95,0:02:59.16,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Here you go, Fuu.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.16,0:03:00.33,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.20,0:03:03.66,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,So did you ask for one too?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.66,0:03:06.71,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,A souvenir? No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.04,0:03:09.79,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Then I'll share mine with you!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.76,0:03:16.22,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,By the way, you were singing before,\Nweren't you, big sis?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.97,0:03:19.22,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Singing?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.31,0:03:28.23,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,You heard that?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.81,0:03:31.98,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I just got the urge to sing out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.57,0:03:33.82,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.17,0:03:58.63,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Fuu, do you want to go out\Nsomewhere to play later?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.51,0:04:00.85,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Can we?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.85,0:04:03.06,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Then let's go to an amusement park!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.56,0:04:06.23,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I want to ride a roller coaster with you!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.73,0:04:08.35,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,A roller coaster...?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.90,0:04:10.19,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What about a freefall?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.94,0:04:12.90,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I could try it, I suppose.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.90,0:04:14.28,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,A haunted house!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.40,0:04:20.91,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm kidding. Let's ride a ferris wheel!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.91,0:04:22.28,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.87,0:04:26.79,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's already been a year, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.75,0:04:31.25,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Ah, I meant because it's summer again!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.58,0:04:34.25,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes. It's getting a lot warmer.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.05,0:04:38.42,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hey big sis, just thinking...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.13,0:04:42.43,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What would you do if someone\Nyou got along with suddenly disappeared?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.18,0:04:45.68,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.06,0:04:52.19,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You know, they're with you all the time,\Nbut then they transfer, and now they're not.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.36,0:04:57.44,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I suppose I'd feel sad if I didn't get to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.44,0:04:59.82,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.49,0:05:01.66,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Fuu?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.66,0:05:03.70,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.16,0:05:06.49,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Forgot to say my thanks!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.37,0:05:08.79,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Thank you for the food!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.17,0:05:20.17,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What could be on her mind?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.18,0:05:25.18,Default,Momo,0,0,0,,Nonoyama-san, did you see that drama last night?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.18,0:05:25.93,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What drama?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.93,0:05:28.31,Default,Mizuka,0,0,0,,{\i1}Flower of Mystery{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.31,0:05:29.77,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes, I did!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.77,0:05:33.15,Default,Mizuka,0,0,0,,You did?! I'm such a big fan of Tachibana-kun!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.15,0:05:34.52,Default,Momo,0,0,0,,He's so handsome!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.52,0:05:36.77,Default,Mizuka,0,0,0,,Nonoko-chan is cute too!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.77,0:05:37.48,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.86,0:05:41.20,Default,Momo,0,0,0,,"And so, through a sorrowful conflict..."
Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.20,0:05:43.41,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,"A flower of mystery falls."
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.91,0:05:46.91,Default,Mizuka,0,0,0,,That was good, Rui-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.91,0:05:48.33,Default,Momo,0,0,0,,You're like an actor!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.33,0:05:49.62,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm not all that.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.95,0:05:53.29,Default,Momo,0,0,0,,You seem a lot more cheerful now, Nonoyama-san.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.29,0:05:54.38,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I do?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.38,0:05:58.88,Default,Mizuka,0,0,0,,We've always wanted to chat with you\Nlike this, Rui-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.88,0:05:59.88,Default,Momo,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.34,0:06:02.76,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.05,0:06:05.72,Default,Mizuka,0,0,0,,Also, not to mention the heroine, but...!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.72,0:06:08.18,Default,Momo,0,0,0,,We know, you envy her, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.18,0:06:09.27,Default,Mizuka,0,0,0,,Hey now.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.65,0:06:19.15,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Azuki, have I gotten more cheerful?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.44,0:06:20.82,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.11,0:06:23.24,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.20,0:06:33.54,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It seems I've changed a bit.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.00,0:06:35.08,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.01,0:06:47.76,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,A letter?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.85,0:06:54.52,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What do these characters say?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.73,0:06:57.31,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,They're magic characters.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.81,0:06:59.32,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Can you read them?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.82,0:07:04.61,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,It says: "Notice from the Festival:\NSongstress Invitation"!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.61,0:07:07.32,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Festival... Songstress?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.24,0:07:09.99,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Does that mean...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.74,0:07:12.62,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Is this for me?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.62,0:07:14.96,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Or perhaps...?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.67,0:07:18.25,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.13,0:07:24.13,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's hot out.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.22,0:07:28.34,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I totally forgot.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.34,0:07:29.55,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.05,0:07:31.64,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,The end of my promise.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.64,0:07:35.39,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I was told I could only use magic for one year.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.81,0:07:36.98,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.40,0:07:40.56,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Did you forget too, Uguisu?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.56,0:07:41.86,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.32,0:07:44.90,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It was so much fun.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.03,0:07:50.28,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Transforming, becoming an idol, making fans...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.66,0:07:54.83,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Making big sis smile again.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.83,0:07:55.66,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.66,0:07:57.42,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I got used to life in the city.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.42,0:07:59.04,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,I never could.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.04,0:08:01.42,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Really? You fit in well in Harajuku.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.42,0:08:02.92,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Sure did!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.92,0:08:04.92,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I made important friends.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.92,0:08:05.92,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.38,0:08:07.38,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.47,0:08:11.93,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'd hate to disappear without saying anything.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.68,0:08:14.31,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Fuu?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.10,0:08:17.98,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Maybe I should tell everyone.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.44,0:08:19.65,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Tell them what?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.65,0:08:21.15,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,About my magic.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.15,0:08:23.44,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,What?! You can't!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.03,0:08:27.57,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,But if I keep it a secret forever...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.24,0:08:29.95,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,You can't tell anyone!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.99,0:08:35.04,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Azuki!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.33,0:08:38.96,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Fuu said she's going to tell of her magic!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.50,0:08:40.12,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.79,0:08:42.67,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Huh?! Why?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.67,0:08:44.21,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,She doesn't want to hide it.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.59,0:08:47.05,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,That's bad! We have to stop her!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.05,0:08:48.51,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,I already did.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.51,0:08:49.97,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Did you?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.97,0:08:52.76,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.77,0:08:58.56,Default,Clerk,0,0,0,,Thank you, come again.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.64,0:09:01.06,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,It's so hot.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.06,0:09:02.73,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,That's summer for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.73,0:09:04.52,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,So you got everyone together?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.52,0:09:05.40,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.03,0:09:09.78,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It's kind of short notice,\Nbut I hope they'll be happy about it.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.78,0:09:12.87,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'm sure they'll enjoy it.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.41,0:09:14.16,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.78,0:09:16.91,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,A-A solo concert?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.12,0:09:19.41,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah, next month.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.75,0:09:22.29,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It'll be our very own concert\Njust like we dreamed of!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.79,0:09:28.38,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I know it's tough doing concerts back-to-back,\Nbut we have to hold strong at a time like this.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.05,0:09:31.22,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,A solo...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.22,0:09:32.30,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,concert?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.76,0:09:34.76,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Asahi-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.64,0:09:38.93,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,That's assuring.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.39,0:09:43.27,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,The fireworks show at the offshore parking area\Nwas suddenly postponed.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.77,0:09:46.94,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,So we just barely managed to secure the venue.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.94,0:09:50.99,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Well, how's a concert out in the ocean sound?\NAmazing, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.28,0:09:54.03,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,We're performing out there?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.03,0:09:55.20,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It {\i1}is{\i0} amazing!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.70,0:09:58.20,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.54,0:09:59.79,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.12,0:10:05.21,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,For now you two should focus on\Ntomorrow's song program! Good luck!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.21,0:10:06.75,Default,Fuu/Rui,0,0,0,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.30,0:10:12.97,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Whew!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.97,0:10:15.93,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,My Lilly-chan and Lulu-chan are just inside!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.93,0:10:16.76,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Yours?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.76,0:10:17.72,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Yeah, mine.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.72,0:10:19.60,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,No, they belong to all of us!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.60,0:10:21.23,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,They're mine!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.23,0:10:22.48,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.48,0:10:24.44,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Sho-chan and his friend are here...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.65,0:10:27.82,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,And they won't play with me!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.23,0:10:31.24,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Litto!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.82,0:10:34.57,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula palilula,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.24,0:10:38.37,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,pam pam power!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.92,0:10:52.17,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see my Lilly-chan and Lulu-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:52.17,0:10:53.72,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,I told you, cut that out!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.72,0:10:55.80,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.80,0:11:01.14,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Oh, Lulu-san! It's a pleasure to have you on today.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.14,0:11:04.02,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes, the pleasure is mine as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.31,0:11:05.31,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Best of luck.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.31,0:11:06.06,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.90,0:11:13.99,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It's almost been a year, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.49,0:11:22.12,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I won't get to live this life much longer.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.49,0:11:26.29,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What will I do after it ends?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.21,0:11:28.00,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.34,0:11:30.21,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Taking a break?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.21,0:11:31.71,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.71,0:11:34.21,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I could drink something too.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.59,0:11:36.80,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What should I pick?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.14,0:11:39.22,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lilly-chan.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.85,0:11:42.31,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Did you have something to say yesterday?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.97,0:11:46.27,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,When we were discussing\Nthe concert at the agency yesterday.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.27,0:11:47.90,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh, that.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.77,0:11:49.73,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Never mind that.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.48,0:11:55.99,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,G-Guess what? There were mini rice cakes\Nin the green room!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:55.99,0:11:57.24,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,For us?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.16,0:12:00.41,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,They were bite-sized and went down easy.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.83,0:12:05.20,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,If Asahi-chan were here,\Nshe'd probably look like this.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.88,0:12:12.88,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.71,0:12:14.38,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.96,0:12:16.63,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Nothing, never mind.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:16.63,0:12:19.64,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Let's do our best. Talk to you later!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.64,0:12:21.39,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.85,0:12:24.18,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lilly-chan...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.60,0:12:29.44,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Sounds like the audience is ready!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.81,0:12:34.36,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Here's the next {\i1}Happiness Music{\i0} guest!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.61,0:12:37.11,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.11,0:12:38.07,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Lilly!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.07,0:12:40.11,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Woo, Lilly-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.82,0:12:44.45,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,So cute! Lilly-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:44.45,0:12:47.87,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,I love you forever!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.87,0:12:47.87,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,{\an8}Calm down. Calm down! That's enough!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.45,0:12:47.87,Alt,Sena,0,0,0,,Looks like the mask is off.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.87,0:12:49.96,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,It's CompatoLilly-san.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.96,0:12:52.67,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Please enjoy her song!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.80,0:13:01.22,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\i1}I take off my sneakers, feeling I've grown
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.22,0:13:04.89,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bout to head out in my new fit
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.89,0:13:06.47,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come to me
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.47,0:13:12.40,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll stuff a balloon full of sparkly lights
Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.40,0:13:15.73,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\i1}And create a wonderland
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.70,0:13:30.25,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Thank you for listening, everyone!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.13,0:13:37.50,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,That was a wonderful performance, Lilly-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.01,0:13:41.63,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,It was! You're certainly an idol to stay tuned into!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.63,0:13:43.89,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.89,0:13:50.14,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Ever since your sudden debut last year,\Nyou've quickly risen to stardom!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.52,0:13:53.06,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,What are your thoughts looking back?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.06,0:13:54.40,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.73,0:13:58.40,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,So much stuff has happened over the last year,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.40,0:14:00.86,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,thinking about it makes me dizzy.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.40,0:14:04.82,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,But it's been a blast!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.28,0:14:08.41,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,And it's all thanks to your support!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.58,0:14:11.83,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Thank you. I mean it.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.87,0:14:15.33,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Lilly-san...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.67,0:14:18.59,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,So what are your goals for the future?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.59,0:14:20.96,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,My goals for the future...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.93,0:14:26.47,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.01,0:14:29.22,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Lilly-san?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.52,0:14:36.48,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Um, there's actually something I have to tell you all.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.98,0:14:40.82,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,This is sudden! What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.82,0:14:42.82,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,This wasn't in the script...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.32,0:14:48.58,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'll have to say goodbye to you all soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.33,0:14:51.62,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Goodbye?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.50,0:14:55.58,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Wait, is she graduating?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.58,0:15:00.46,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,You're so silly, Lilly-san.\NSaying this out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.46,0:15:03.09,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Exactly! Don't scare us!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.09,0:15:07.64,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,You must be joking, right?\NNot after the year you put in.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.64,0:15:08.80,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I mean it.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.10,0:15:11.64,Default,Woman 1,0,0,0,,No... Please no!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.64,0:15:12.43,Default,Woman 2,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.43,0:15:14.39,Default,Man 1,0,0,0,,She can't be graduating!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.39,0:15:15.64,Default,Man 2,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.36,0:15:20.61,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lilly! What is she doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.78,0:15:24.36,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Lilly, don't do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.36,0:15:25.61,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Lilly!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.61,0:15:28.91,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa. What is she going on about?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.83,0:15:37.83,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,What is this about, Lilly-san?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.83,0:15:40.79,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I can't say.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.18,0:15:51.68,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Lilly-san, are you sure you want to go this way?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.68,0:15:53.18,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.56,0:15:58.44,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,If we don't know why, we'll be sad.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.45,0:16:07.57,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.24,0:16:09.20,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.07,0:16:10.74,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.12,0:16:14.87,Alt,Oleans,0,0,0,,But magic has to stay a secret.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.87,0:16:17.46,Alt,Mucchi,0,0,0,,If anyone finds out,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.46,0:16:20.33,Alt,Mucchi,0,0,0,,they'll just be trapped in the prison of souls.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.83,0:16:22.09,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Please stop.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.50,0:16:23.75,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.34,0:16:26.92,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I promised not to.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.92,0:16:27.97,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Promised?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.97,0:16:29.47,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.64,0:16:33.47,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I've been using magic.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.47,0:16:36.39,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,That's how I became an idol.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.64,0:16:38.81,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Magic?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.81,0:16:41.23,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Did she say magic?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.45,0:16:53.70,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lilly-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:54.20,0:16:56.25,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lululila pululila,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.25,0:16:58.75,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,please don't take Lilly-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.71,0:17:01.75,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It's not working...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.29,0:17:04.92,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Please, won't you listen to me?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.52,0:17:17.81,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Fuu...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:19.81,0:17:21.81,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Take me in her place!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.37,0:17:39.87,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh, what am I...?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.66,0:17:42.12,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Lulu-san?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.13,0:17:47.88,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I've been using magic.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.88,0:17:50.63,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,That's how I became an idol.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.62,0:18:16.62,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Fuu...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.78,0:18:19.37,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Big sis...?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:19.37,0:18:20.45,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lulu!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.21,0:18:31.88,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lulu... disappeared?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.88,0:18:33.13,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Lulu-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.13,0:18:34.13,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Lulu...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.64,0:18:36.01,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,What in the world?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.39,0:18:38.43,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,L-Lulu-san's gone!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.43,0:18:41.10,Default,Woman 1,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan disappeared...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.10,0:18:42.81,Default,Woman 2,0,0,0,,Was she really using magic?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.81,0:18:44.56,Default,Woman 3,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.56,0:18:48.27,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Where's Lulu? Where was she taken?\NWe have to look for her!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.27,0:18:50.07,Default,Staff 2,0,0,0,,P-Please hold on.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.61,0:18:54.49,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,We apologize for the inconvenience.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.49,0:18:57.37,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,We have to temporarily suspend the program.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.37,0:18:58.58,Default,Man 1,0,0,0,,Huh? Now?!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.12,0:19:00.91,Default,Staff 2,0,0,0,,Lilly-san, please come.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.83,0:19:02.62,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.87,0:19:10.38,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Why is this happening?\NI was the one who spilled the secret of magic.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.38,0:19:12.13,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Did Lulu-chan protect me?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.13,0:19:13.67,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Lulu...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.67,0:19:15.80,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lilly-san, are you okay?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.80,0:19:17.01,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Toko-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.01,0:19:20.81,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened to Lulu either,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:20.81,0:19:23.81,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,but they're searching for her now.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.98,0:19:30.77,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I'm heading off.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.37,0:19:42.24,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Toko, what happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.08,0:19:44.50,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Did you see?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.00,0:19:47.12,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lulu said she used magic.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.12,0:19:48.58,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I saw.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.58,0:19:51.38,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,A lot of weird stuff has happened so far,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.38,0:19:54.13,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,but her using magic...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.34,0:19:59.26,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Lulu-san...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.72,0:20:02.51,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:19.20,0:20:26.00,Default,Reporter,0,0,0,,{\i1}Today, idol MashuLulu-san suddenly disappeared\Nduring a live broadcast.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.00,0:20:29.71,Default,Reporter,0,0,0,,{\i1}A search for Lulu-san is currently underway.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.71,0:20:32.09,Default,Reporter,0,0,0,,{\i1}According to close sources, Lulu-san...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.89,0:20:43.93,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.81,0:20:48.69,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hey, tell me.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.31,0:20:51.35,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Was big sis Lulu-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.27,0:20:55.48,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Did you two know?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.49,0:20:58.49,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.90,0:21:01.53,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Well, where did big sis go?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.53,0:21:02.99,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Please, tell me!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.37,0:21:04.79,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,We don't...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.79,0:21:06.41,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,know either.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.17,0:21:17.38,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.26,0:21:25.81,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Big... sis?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.48,0:21:35.07,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Th-Thank goodness. You're okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.07,0:21:35.90,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.86,0:21:38.53,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What a relief!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.57,0:21:42.07,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Big sis...?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.41,0:21:44.24,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Fuu?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.54,0:21:49.83,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Me? What about you?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.83,0:21:52.96,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Big sis, what happened to you earlier?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.54,0:21:57.21,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Big sis, you're Lulu-chan, aren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.26,0:21:59.55,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lulu?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.26,0:22:01.42,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.55,0:22:08.06,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Do you not remember what happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:09.06,0:22:11.60,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Fuu, what are you talking about?
Comment: 0,0:02:15.03,0:02:20.04,Signs,,0,0,0,,Lilly Retires as an Idol?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.03,0:02:20.04,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnCC EmpireStateGothic\fscx200\pos(960,628)\blur0.5}Lilly Retires as an Idol?!
