Comment: 0,0:00:44.02,0:00:44.06,OP,,0,0,0,sync,sync
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.44,0:00:46.94,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}La-la-la-la, dam-da
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.94,0:00:49.24,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Di-di-ta-ta, di-di-ta
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.24,0:00:52.11,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}La-la-la-la, dam-da
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.07,0:00:55.41,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Chant the spell slowly{ゆっくり唱えて}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.08,0:00:58.08,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Wrap yourself in a secret{秘密まとうの}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.08,0:01:00.12,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Logic overflowing around{あふれる論理}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.00,0:01:02.87,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Let's blow it all away{蹴散らしてゆこう}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.88,0:01:06.21,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}My daily routine's getting boring{退屈な日常}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.21,0:01:09.80,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}But when I met you it started swingin'{キミと出会った瞬間Swingin'}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.47,0:01:13.39,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}The time began to fly{時が走り出すよ}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.80,0:01:17.39,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Enjoying the nightlife, my heart racing{跳ねる心臓の夜遊び}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.39,0:01:21.81,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}There's no stopping this dream{この夢は止まれないよ}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.81,0:01:24.48,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Hey, come over here{ねぇこっちにおいで}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.48,0:01:27.02,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Swingin' magic
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.02,0:01:29.15,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Don't leave me{話さないで}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.15,0:01:31.95,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Swingin' magic
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.57,0:01:34.87,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Just dance the way you feel{感じるままに踊れば}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.87,0:01:36.78,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}And the joy will only grow{ときめきもっと増えるよ}
