Dialogue: 2,0:22:28.99,0:22:33.91,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Where do we start? (Do-re-mi-fa) We leave it up to God {どれから(ドレミファ)神様の言う(とおりじゃ)}
Dialogue: 2,0:22:31.95,0:22:35.96,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6\an8}But that's boring{つまんないから}
Dialogue: 2,0:22:33.91,0:22:36.92,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}So if I decide for myself{自分で選んだら}
Dialogue: 2,0:22:35.96,0:22:39.75,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6\an8}Start piling things on and it'll start to move{あれこれ　乗っけて　まわり出す}
Dialogue: 2,0:22:53.47,0:23:01.06,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}If I peer into the hearts of people passing by{すれちがう人　心を覗き込めたら}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:01.06,0:23:04.36,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}What are they dreaming of? They're sparkling and shining{どんな夢をみてる？キラキラ光って}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:04.36,0:23:09.95,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Just like precious jewels {宝石みたいに　大切な}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:08.45,0:23:15.62,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6\an8}If the fragments of dreams scattered around the world{世界中散らばる　夢のかけらたちをね}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:14.08,0:23:15.62,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Could be lined up{せんぶ並べ}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:15.62,0:23:22.17,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}And granted on the count of three, it'd be amazing{せーの！でかなえたら　アメイジング}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:22.21,0:23:24.63,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Dreams à la mode, for you{どりぃむアラモード For you}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:24.96,0:23:29.68,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}I'll make our planet into a great big dessert dish{この星はきっと大きめの　デザートディッシュ}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:29.68,0:23:35.93,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Load it up with all your excitement, it's OK!{ときめきをありったけ　乗せてOK！なの！}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:35.31,0:23:36.98,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6\an8}Yes it is!{なの！なの！}
